# TanStack Table Plugin

Advanced data tables with sorting, filtering, pagination, and column visibility control.

## Files Added

- `src/components/ui/data-table/index.tsx` — Production-ready DataTable component
- `docs/tanstack-table.md` — Complete guide and examples

## Quick Start

```tsx
import { DataTable } from "@/components/ui/data-table";

const columns = [
  { accessorKey: "name", header: "Name" },
  { accessorKey: "email", header: "Email" },
];

export function MyTable() {
  return <DataTable columns={columns} data={users} globalFilterColumn="name" />;
}
```

## Features

✓ Sorting (click headers)  
✓ Global filtering  
✓ Pagination  
✓ Row selection  
✓ Column visibility  
✓ Full TypeScript support  
✓ Accessible (WCAG)

See `docs/tanstack-table.md` for advanced examples.
